    "HOW TO USE\n1. Press Run. The prompt is already filled in.\n2. Make your own: keep the words that describe HER, change WHERE she is and WHAT she wears.\n   A good prompt has 4 parts: who she is / what she's wearing / where she is / how the photo was taken (phone, flash, film, night).\n3. Style add-on (Secret Sauce): strength 1.0 = full look. Too much? Try 0.7.\n4. Light add-on (Lenovo): makes the light look like a phone photo. Set it to 0 to turn it off.\n\nSettings: Krea 2 Turbo, 8 steps, CFG 1, res_multistep / simple, 832 x 1248. No trigger word needed."
